  "notes": "Previewed with o3 on 2024-12-20 and released on 2025-01-31. The launch post says o3-mini does not support vision; the docs list text input only. o3-mini-high is the ChatGPT name of the high reasoning effort setting. In ChatGPT, o3, o4-mini and o4-mini-high replaced o1, o3-mini and o3-mini-high on 2025-04-16 (src.openai.o3-o4-mini-announcement). The 2026-04-22 deprecation lists o3-mini-2025-01-31 with the alias o3-mini and a shutdown date of 2026-10-23, so retired is left empty until then."
